stencies in prominent physical features.\n\nType: Physical Description\n\nRoot Cause: Likely author miscommunication—Story D author may not have accessed Story A's character sheet.\n</example_evaluation>\n\nProduce structured evaluations the Reporter can transform into actionable editorial guidance. Group related contradictions when they stem from the same root cause (e.g., multiple timeline errors in one story suggest that author lacked a master timeline).",
